<title>USA: N.Y. Fed Press Briefing - July 31.</title>
<headline>N.Y. Fed Press Briefing - July 31.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said it had no large one-day net miss in its reserve projections in the latest week, a Fed spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The high in natural float was about $490 million on Monday, while the low in natural float was about $115 million on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Transportation float averaged about $65 million per day with the high on Thursday at about $150 million mainly due to aircraft mechincal problems from the New York area to the Westcast.</p>
<p>(( -- Caryn Trokie, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
</text>
